OK, let's now get into this crazy situation
that we have to discuss.

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:11.330
The guy who died supposedly from taking Trump's
proposed cure for Corona virus.

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:16.940
Donald Trump has been touting chloroquine
and hydroxy chloroquine as a possible cure

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:18.810
or prevention for Corona virus.

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:25.350
Now, it is true that chloroquine, with and
without a zero Meissen, is being studied in

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:31.640
