settings where the patient would be a good

00:01:16.329 --> 00:01:17.619
candidate for that.

00:01:17.619 --> 00:01:21.159
According to this guy's widow, he kept seeing
Trump.

00:01:21.159 --> 00:01:26.450
And people around Trump say this could cure
Corona virus, this could prevent Corona virus.

00:01:26.450 --> 00:01:30.380
